# LinkedIn Jobs SearXNG

A tool to search and scrape LinkedIn jobs using a local SearXNG instance.

## Installation

```bash
pip install -e .
```

## Usage

```bash
linkedin-jobs "software engineer python"
```

Or run interactively:
```bash
linkedin-jobs
```

## Development

```bash
pip install -e ".[dev]"
pytest
```
